ind":"update","title":"HoloBind 0.3 Update","summary":"Adds a shared virtual gamepad feature, plus improvements to parts of the interface and mapping behavior.🎮 Shared virtual gamepads: Multiple devices can now output to the same virtual gamepad.🖱️ Configuration interface polish: The configuration interface has been smoothed out, and adding mappings is more intuitive.🎨 Skin themes: You can now change a device's display theme color at any time.⚡ Fixed mapping errors in special cases: Under certain mapping rule setups, rapidly pressing keys could rele","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:42:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690283","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4203760-1846651706681986","game_id":"steam-4203760","kind":"announcement","title":"HoloBind 0.2.1 更新公告","summary":"A small release: one behavior bug fixed, plus a round of polish on the mapping effect editors.- 🛡️ Inverted whitelist bug (fixed): With \"Invert app list\" on, the app added itself to the list as well, so it couldn't see the controller it had just hidden.- 🎚️ Mapping effect editor polish: The mapping effect editors have been reworked, with \"response mode + action\" merged into an \"action mode\" dropdown.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T15:43:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681986","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4203760-1846018067944308","game_id":"steam-4203760","kind":"update","title":"HoloBind 0.2 Update","summary":"This update adds several new capabilities and fixes a batch of issues with feel and the app interface.✨ New features🕹️ Stick increment logic New options in the mouse-move increment mode, for more granular control over how movement is applied.🔗 Stick value projection A stick can project its own value onto another stick component, letting it drive that component's behavior.🧭 Gyroscope inertia mapping The gyroscope mapping behavior now has an inertia property.🎮 Virtual gamepad creation policy Each ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:56:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4203760-1846018067935091","game_id":"steam-4203760","kind":"announcement","title":"Renamed, and the Demo is live","summary":"What was formerly known as \"ExtremeControl Mapping\" is now HoloBind. This is a name change only — features, your settings, and store links are all unaffected.At the same time, the free Demo is now live on Steam. You can download and try it right away. If you run into any issues or have suggestions during the Demo, let us know in the community. If you find it useful, please add it to your wishlist.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T01:16:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935091","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4203760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4203760":"2026-10-26T01:48:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4203760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4421930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:46Z","status":"ok